Single-database configuration for Flask.
To migrate perform the sequence of commands:
```
flask db init # only if you haven't ran this before
flask db migrate -m "Updated users schema"
flask db upgrade
```

Resources:
https://realpython.com/flask-by-example-part-2-postgres-sqlalchemy-and-alembic/

Sometimes you may get target head not up to date:
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/17768940/target-database-is-not-up-to-date